      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. another thing though, it's not just the amount itself, it's the way it feels. like, the entries are so tiny and just... sporadically placed. they feel like they're just tucked away in the margins where no one would look. what's the best way to spot if these are being intentionally hidden by someone who knows the system well?",
